      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 220,
        "content": "## demo-ticket-triage\nTwo LLM calls per run, two providers: **Groq** classifies, **Claude** drafts the reply. Exists so the Ops Console cost meter has real spend to count.\n\nFire it with `scripts/fire-triage.sh`. Error workflow: ops-error-handler."
      }
    }
